menu "Temperature monitor peripherals"
config MONITOR_SIMULATION
    bool "Development-only simulated probes and accelerated history"
    default n
    help
        Runs five explicitly simulated probes without touching GPIO4. Uses separate
        NVS/history storage and marks every API snapshot as simulated. Never use as
        evidence of physical sensor verification.
config MONITOR_SIM_REPLACEMENT_TEST
    bool "Simulate a disconnected saved probe and one excess replacement ROM"
    depends on MONITOR_SIMULATION
    default n
    help
        Test-only simulation mode. Omits ROM 1 from readings and adds ROM 6 so a
        saved five-probe registry can exercise durable retirement and replacement.
        It never enables or accesses the physical sensor bus.
config MONITOR_SENSOR_BUS
    bool "Enable physical DS18B20 bus on GPIO4"
    depends on !MONITOR_SIMULATION
    default n
    help
        Enable after connecting the powered probes and a single external 4.7k pull-up.
        Leave disabled for bare-board tests. This does not enable the LCD/backlight.
endmenu
